Third-party data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project consumes publicly available datasets. The datasets are NOT
distributed with this repository; they are downloaded by the user with the
scripts provided. Each dataset keeps its own licence and attribution
requirements, recorded in DATA.md:

  * ESA Anomaly Dataset (ESA-ADB) — European Space Agency, Airbus Defence and
    Space, KP Labs. Licensed under CC BY 3.0 IGO.
    https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.12528696

  * OPSSAT-AD — European Space Agency / KP Labs. Licensed under CC BY 4.0.
    https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15108715

  * Mars Express Power dataset — European Space Agency. Licensed under
    CC BY 4.0. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6327379

  * SMAP / MSL telemetry — National Aeronautics and Space Administration.
    https://github.com/khundman/telemanom

  * NASA Prognostics Center of Excellence datasets — National Aeronautics and
    Space Administration. https://data.phmsociety.org/nasa/

  * Orbital element sets — CelesTrak / Space-Track.org.

  * Space weather data — NOAA Space Weather Prediction Center.

